PLAIN ENGLISH SUMMARY (not legally binding)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  FREE:   One developer using Meridian for their own projects — personal
          or commercial. Including CI/CD pipelines you own and run yourself.

  PAID:   Any shared, team, or multi-human use. Any deployment where more
          than one person accesses the same Meridian instance. Any use
          inside an organization as shared infrastructure.

  NEVER:  Offering Meridian itself as a hosted service to third parties,
          or any product that competes directly with Meridian's commercial
          offerings, during the Protection Period.

  LATER:  After the Protection Period, this license converts to Apache 2.0.
          Everything becomes fully open source.

